e=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">  -0.0919 0.0791 -1.16   0.245</span><u></u><u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">AIC: -4057.069</span><u></u><u></u></p></div></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p></div><div><pre style=\"font-size:9pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">However, I don&#39;t get the same error when I fit the same models with poisson mixture.</span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></pre><pre style=\"font-size:9pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">This looks similar to questions previously asked on the group, although it&#39;s not clear if those questions were resolved.</span><u></u><u></u></pre><pre><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/unmarked/riAilwgsCX0/Lm8OdM9fCUoJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!msg/unmarked/riAilwgsCX0/Lm8OdM9fCUoJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452450538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw30ZKdiuxB54rtmX_y-vWK2\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/unmarked/riAilwgsCX0/Lm8OdM9fCUoJ</a></span><u></u><u></u></pre><pre><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/unmarked/GuNwVDOfn38/hH1s9yccHZkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!msg/unmarked/GuNwVDOfn38/hH1s9yccHZkJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452450538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20Y0QTDFcaL5nijIOZjt0W\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!msg/unmarked/GuNwVDOfn38/hH1s9yccHZkJ</a></span><u></u><u></u></pre><pre style=\"font-s